s in ## Music) and one of a tree with pink flowers (details in ## Boston trip) [S8T1][S8T2][S8T3][S8T5]. They talked about nature: Dave has been exploring parks on weekends to relax; Calvin, having never been to Boston, is \"can't wait\" to visit in July 2023 and asked about the Boston parks (details in ## Boston trip); when Calvin asked if Dave has been on any hikes recently, Dave said no but thinks hiking is awesome — \"being in nature and pushing yourself to new heights\"; details on Dave's park habit and his Boston-parks stroll are in /memories/dave.md > ## Parks [S8T4][S8T5][S8T6][S8T7][S8T8]. Then Dave announced he had booked a trip to a mountainous region for next month (July 2023), and Calvin said he wants to go on a hike in the mountains to de-stress himself (details in ## Mountains and hiking); the two wished each other well for the trip and signed off \"see you soon\" (details in /memories/dave.md > ## Mountain trip (July 2023)) [S8T9][S8T10][S8T11][S8T12][S8T13][S8T14].\n- On 2023-06-21, told Dave about the car accident and repair process (details in ## Car accident (2023-06-16)); Dave expressed sympathy that no one was hurt, asked about issues with the insurance process and how long it took, and asked about the mechanic in the garage photo [S9T2][S9T4][S9T6][S9T8].\n- The 2023-06-21 conversation continued: Calvin answered Dave's skiing question — never tried it, but it looks like \"a lot of fun\" and he might try it once (details in ## Mountains and hiking) [S9T17]. Dave then announced that he recently joined a rock band and has been practicing guitar, sharing a photo of the band; Calvin said it's awesome and will bring him a lot of emotions, and Dave said good company and great music lift the mood and bring positive emotions (details in the Rock band section of /memories/dave.md). The conversation closed with Dave saying he had to go and \"I'll see you soon!\", and Calvin thanking Dave and saying \"let's keep in touch, take care!\" [S9T18][S9T19][S9T20][S9T21].\n- On 2023-07-07, caught up with Dave: Dave asked how the car was doing after the crash, and Calvin said it's all good now — fixed and going strong — sharing a photo of the red sports car parked on the side of the road (details in ## Car accident (2023-06-16)). Dave said he's been hanging out with friends at parks; Calvin shared photos of his mansion's backyard (a boat docked in a canal at sunset) and the mansion front, and Dave marveled at the views from the Japanese mansion (details in ## New home (2023-03-23)) [S10T1][S10T2][S10T3][S10T5][S10T6][S10T7][S10T8].\n- The 2023-07-07 conversation continued: Calvin is looking forward to trying the Japanese food and checking out the culture; when Dave said he has never been to Japan but is \"so keen to go one day\" and is \"hooked on\" Japanese music, Calvin said Japan \"definitely has it all\" — vibes, food, tech, and an amazing culture, \"like stepping into another world\" — and told him he's working on music collaborations with Japanese artists; Dave can't wait for the tunes, and Calvin promised to share clips and \"can't wait to show you\" the results. The conversation closed with Calvin thanking Dave, \"Appreciate all the help\", and saying \"Great catching up, gotta get back to work now. Take care!\" (Dave's Japan travel interest is in /memories/dave.md > ## Japan) [S10T9][S10T10][S10T11][S10T12][S10T13][S10T14][S10T15][S10T16]. Dave's final sign-off: \"Hey Cal, take care and don't overwork yourself! Talk to you soon. Stay safe!\" [S10T17].","text_sha256":"027077eb925a23d98143100ce2e70e0fe236b21a5a846538dfc71bd0f129fa5d","timestamp":null},{"attribution_index_sha256":"98109144a5a23da7a5b89634be2c543ea2366f2abe85f1f3f8a3df64a5e92ce2","attribution_units":[{"dia_ids":["D8:9"],"kind":"curated_fact","line_end":90,"line_start":90,"source_locators":["[S8T9]"],"text_sha256":"df5bbae63a4cb4041ecfd1373461adffb080c8b30a8a60a06a2794b422904984"},{"dia_ids":["D9:15","D9:16","D9:17"],"kind":"curated_fact","line_end":91,"